    "text": "Scenes from Don Quixote by Spain's Compania Nacional de Danza. [Photo provided to chinadaily.com.cn] The 7th China International Ballet Season kicked off at Beijing's Tianqiao Theatre on Tuesday, marking the beginning of a cultural exchange between China and Spain.\nThe highlight of the event was the debut of Spain's Compania Nacional de Danza, which brought their stunning rendition of Don Quixote to the stage from Friday to Sunday.\nThe China International Ballet Season is a prestigious biennial event organized by the National Ballet of China and hosted at the Tianqiao Theatre. This event has attracted top artists from 58 ballet companies spanning 27 countries.",
